A more compact battery card in Noctalia's Power tab (gemini-pda-mainline, MIT).

The owner asked for a more compact battery panel (2026-11-11) and chose this layout: the time
left follows the state ("Discharging · 3h 20m"), and the charge rate, the temperature and the
battery health share one line, so the separate Battery Health card goes. Applies after
gemini-battery-temp.patch. Gemini-only, not part of the upstream temperature change.

